        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Republic New York Corporation, Republic National Bank of New York, Safra Republic Bank, HSBC Bank USA, HSBC Holdings PLC\n- Roles: holding company, chairman, US subsidiary\n- Places: New York, United States, Hong Kong\n\nFacts:\n- Republic New York Corporation was the holding company for the Republic National Bank of New York and Safra Republic Bank.\n- HSBC Bank USA was the US subsidiary of HSBC Holdings PLC.\n- HSBC Holdings PLC was a British multinational banking and financial services holding company that traced its origin to a hong in Hong Kong.\n- Republic New York Corporation was sold to HSBC Bank USA in 2013 shortly after the death of its chairman.",
